  </div>
  <div class="scroll"></div>
</header>

<!-- 2 COUPLE -->
<section class="couple"><div class="w">
  <div class="p1"><div class="por" data-mask><span data-k="brideI">A</span></div><span class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:2rem">The Bride</span><h3 data-r data-k="bride">Alya Putri</h3><p data-r>A curator of quiet moments, who finds poetry in morning light, old bookshops and the people she loves.</p></div>
  <div class="p2"><div class="por" data-mask><span data-k="groomI">R</span></div><span class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:2rem">The Groom</span><h3 data-r data-k="groom">Rizky Pratama</h3><p data-r>An architect of small kindnesses, steady as a lighthouse, and forever the first to make her laugh.</p></div>
</div></section>

<!-- 3 TIMELINE: story + first meeting -->
<section class="tl" id="tl">
  <div class="yr"><span id="yr">2019</span></div>
  <div class="st"><div><span class="eyebrow">First Meeting</span><h3>A rainy afternoon, one shared umbrella</h3><p>In a Bandung café, two strangers reached for the last table — and stayed for the whole conversation.</p></div></div>
