  <div class="st"><div><span class="eyebrow">Our Story</span><h3>Yes, in every language</h3><p>On a hilltop at sunset, he asked. She had already said yes a thousand times.</p></div></div>
  <div class="bar"><i></i></div>
</section>

<!-- 5 JOURNEY horizontal -->
<section class="hz" id="hz">
  <h2 class="ti">Our <em>journey</em></h2>
  <div class="trk">
    <div style="flex:0 0 40vw"></div>
    <div class="pn glass"><b>01</b><div><h3>Hello</h3><p>Coffee, rain, and a number scribbled on a napkin.</p></div></div>
    <div class="pn glass"><b>02</b><div><h3>Adventures</h3><p>Night trains, mountain mornings, and getting happily lost.</p></div></div>
    <div class="pn glass"><b>03</b><div><h3>Home</h3><p>Two toothbrushes, one shelf of books, a shared life.</p></div></div>
    <div class="pn glass"><b>04</b><div><h3>Forever</h3><p>Every road led here, to you.</p></div></div>
