  <p data-r style="max-width:48ch;margin:1.5rem auto 0">Should you wish to honour us further, a contribution toward our first home is warmly welcomed.</p>
  <div class="glass" data-r><span class="eyebrow">Bank Transfer</span><b class="serif" style="font-size:1.8rem" data-k="bank">BCA · 123 456 7890</b><br><span data-k="bankName">a.n. Alya Putri</span></div>
</div></section>

<!-- 18 WISHES -->
<section><div class="w">
  <span class="eyebrow">Guest Book</span><h2 data-r>Warm <em>wishes</em></h2>
  <div class="wl" id="wl">
    <div class="glass"><b>Nadia</b><p>May your love grow quieter and deeper every year.</p></div>
